## Pre-workshop setup

Before the day of the workshop, please have the following ready (to avoid wifi bottlenecks on the day):

1. **WordPress Studio** installed — download at [developer.wordpress.com/studio](https://developer.wordpress.com/studio). Create a new site running WordPress `{{WP_VERSION}}` and have it ready.
2. **Node.js** (LTS) installed — recommended via [NVM](https://github.com/nvm-sh/nvm).
3. Clone this repo into your site's `wp-content/{{WP_TARGET}}s/` directory:
   ```bash
   git clone {{REPO_URL}} wp-content/{{WP_TARGET}}s/{{PLUGIN_SLUG}}
   ```
4. Install dependencies and build:
   ```bash
   cd wp-content/{{WP_TARGET}}s/{{PLUGIN_SLUG}}
   npm install
   npm run build
   ```
5. Activate via WP-CLI or the WordPress admin:
   ```bash
   studio wp {{WP_TARGET}} activate {{PLUGIN_SLUG}}
   ```

**Alternatively**, use the one-click `blueprint.json` with [WP Playground](https://playground.wordpress.net/) to skip local setup.

